# DentPlan voice test scripts
# Play each script into the microphone with a text-to-speech app, one at a time:
# click "Dictate", play the script, press "Send", and wait for the assistant to answer
# before playing the next one. The patient is fictional.

=== SCRIPT 1 - First dictation ===
# Tests: stages, intervals, list prices, a dictated price, an item discount.
# The crown material on 36 is left open on purpose, so the assistant should ask about it.

New patient, Daniel Novak. Stage one: start with a consultation, a panoramic x-ray and professional hygiene.
Then fillings on teeth fourteen and twenty-five.
Root canal treatment on tooth thirty-six, and two weeks later a crown on thirty-six.
Tooth forty-six cannot be saved, extract it.
Three months after the extraction, place an Osstem implant on forty-six, implant price eight hundred and fifty euros.
Three months after the implant, a zirconia crown on the implant on forty-six.
Give thirty percent off the hygiene.

=== SCRIPT 2 - Answers ===
# Answers the likely questions (crown material and price on 36).
# If the assistant asked something else, answer that instead.

The crown on thirty-six is zirconia, price three hundred and eighty euros.
Two visits for the root canal stage.

=== SCRIPT 3 - A change, then Undo ===
# Tests: highlighted changes ("new" / "updated" tags) and the plan-wide discount.
# Afterwards click "Undo": the plan goes back and this text returns to the box.

Also add a check-up and hygiene six months after the last stage.
The patient is a teacher, give ten percent off the whole plan.

=== SCRIPT 4 - Tricky one ===
# Tests: switching the implant system, an item discount on the abutment,
# fixing a speech-to-text mistake ("route canal"), and a follow-up question about 37.

Actually make the implant on tooth forty six a Straumann implant, and the healing abutment with a twenty percent discount.
Route canal on thirty seven as well.

=== Finally ===
# Click "I'm satisfied -> PDF". The PDF should show the tooth chart with 14, 25, 36, 37
# and 46 coloured by stage, the timeline, and the discounts.
